 Tori

       +-------------------------------------------+        
       |                                           |        
       |  Keys                                     |        
       |                                           |        
       |  up/dn / j k Move selection               |        
       |  enter       Switch account               |        
       |  tab         Jump to next tool            |        
       |  a           Add account                  |        
       |  d           Remove account               |        
       |  u           Toggle meters for tool       |        
       |  b           Rotate all tools             |        
       |  r           Refresh usage now            |        
       |  q           Quit                         |        
       |                                           |        
       |  bar = quota left - | = time until reset  |        
       |                                           |        
       |  esc close                                |        
       |                                           |        
       +-------------------------------------------+        
                                                            